## 📊 Quick Comparison Table

| Concept            | Key Use Case | Example |
|--------------------|-------------|---------|
| `any` vs `unknown` | Flexibility vs safety | `let x: any; let y: unknown;` |
| Generics           | Reusable components | `function identity<T>(arg: T): T` |
| Interfaces vs Types| Contracts vs flexibility | `interface User {name:string}` vs `type User={name:string}` |
| Decorators         | Metadata/annotations | `@Component({...})` in Angular |
| Utility Types      | Type transformations | `Partial<User>` makes all props optional |

