## ⚠️ Common Pitfalls to Watch
- Overusing `any` → defeats TypeScript’s purpose.  
- Mixing `namespace` with ES modules → leads to confusion.  
- Forgetting to configure `tsconfig.json` properly → can cause compilation/runtime mismatches.  
- Not handling `strictNullChecks` → runtime errors sneak in.  

